{"id":"ca21b68a25f1afc2","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-sequent.md","title":"Modal Sequent","display":"df-modal-sequent — Modal Sequent","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-sequent","aliases":["89-df-modal-sequent"],"display":"df-modal-sequent — Modal Sequent","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-modal-implication]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-sequent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-sequent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-sequent — Modal Sequent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> is the set of finite sequences of\nmodal formulas; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\rangle\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbin{{}^\\frown}\">\\(\\mathbin{{}^\\frown}\\)</span> denote the\nempty sequence and concatenation.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seq}_{\\Box}=\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{Seq}_{\\Box}=\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是下述定义的模态序贯载体。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}sequent}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Seq}_{\\Box}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\times\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\top&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\bot,\\\\\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\top,\n&amp;\\bigwedge(\\Gamma{}^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq(\\bigwedge\\Gamma)\\land A,\\\\\n\\bigvee\\langle\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,\n&amp;\\bigvee(\\Delta{}^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg\\bigvee\\Delta\\land\\neg A),\\\\\n\\tau_{\\Box}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigwedge\\Gamma\\to\\bigvee\\Delta,\\\\\n\\Box_{*}(\\Gamma)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\Box\\Gamma_i\\mid i&lt;|\\Gamma|\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}sequent}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Seq}_{\\Box}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\times\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\top&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\bot,\\\\\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\top,\n&amp;\\bigwedge(\\Gamma{}^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq(\\bigwedge\\Gamma)\\land A,\\\\\n\\bigvee\\langle\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,\n&amp;\\bigvee(\\Delta{}^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg\\bigvee\\Delta\\land\\neg A),\\\\\n\\tau_{\\Box}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigwedge\\Gamma\\to\\bigvee\\Delta,\\\\\n\\Box_{*}(\\Gamma)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\Box\\Gamma_i\\mid i&lt;|\\Gamma|\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seq}_\\Box\">\\(\\mathrm{Seq}_\\Box\\)</span> : 模态序贯集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_{*}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Box_{*}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> : 保持次序地把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 应用于序列中所有公式。</li>\n<li>使用有限序列而非无序有限集，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge\">\\(\\bigwedge\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee\">\\(\\bigvee\\)</span> 的语法递归唯一。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-implication]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbin{{}^\\frown}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Seq}_{\\Box}=\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}sequent}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Seq}_{\\Box}\n&\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}\n\\times\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega},\\\\\n\\top&\\coloneqq\\neg\\bot,\\\\\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\rangle&\\coloneqq\\top,\n&\\bigwedge(\\Gamma{}^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle)\n&\\coloneqq(\\bigwedge\\Gamma)\\land A,\\\\\n\\bigvee\\langle\\rangle&\\coloneqq\\bot,\n&\\bigvee(\\Delta{}^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle)\n&\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg\\bigvee\\Delta\\land\\neg A),\\\\\n\\tau_{\\Box}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\n&\\coloneqq\n\\bigwedge\\Gamma\\to\\bigvee\\Delta,\\\\\n\\Box_{*}(\\Gamma)\n&\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\Box\\Gamma_i\\mid i<|\\Gamma|\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Seq}_\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_{*}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigvee","display":false}],"bytes":1514,"backlinks":[{"id":"6d8c3016a32d17f8","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0b3c8928cef7eaa4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b0e5598f570a6835","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限合取与析取按序列折叠，空合取为 $\\top$，空析取为 $\\bot$，see [[89-df-modal-sequent]]。$\\Diamond A=\\neg\\Box\\neg A$。"},{"id":"18a7d6d6f6148b37","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"932deccafc8aeaa8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"413ee4c6aedeb326","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9951d1dd53a3ed60","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38f802289559e5da","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ea2ed81f5a3df51c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffd0dbc00149f28a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7c0e4d58dc068222","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-374","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-sequent]]"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d","32c9990061b9749d","d246470e97fec132"]}